  "published": "2026-11-14T22:17:22.937Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Tab icons and a smaller, tidier orb menu. RibbonTab has an Image property: the icon is drawn to the left of the tab text, scaled to fit the tab while keeping its aspect ratio, and the tab is measured wider so the text is never clipped. The design-time orb menu is now a single stacked column sized exactly to its rows plus the add-buttons footer - no reserved empty pane, no divider, and an empty menu is only the add buttons. Orb entries with no caption and no icon show a placeholder instead of an invisible row, the same item added twice is listed once, every entry including separators opens the same context menu on left or right click, Delete really removes the entry from its collection, and the context menu opens against the clicked row without covering the footer buttons. Includes the 1.0.26 fix that lets the Properties grid's collection editor Add concrete items instead of failing on the abstract RibbonItem. Runtime behaviour is otherwise unchanged.",
